<title>UK: HSBC appoints Gray chairman HSBC Markets.</title>
<headline>HSBC appoints Gray chairman HSBC Markets.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>HSBC Holdings on Wednesday announced that Robert Gray, managing director global capital markets, was appointed chairman of HSBC Markets Ltd.</p>
<p>Gray will take over from Stephen Green to whom he will continue to report.</p>
<p>HSBC Markets houses the banking group's international debt capital market operations.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
